      "body": "Standard: peer:src/commands/content.rs:82 (update path renders the server result directly) / doc comment replaced in this diff: `json 直接输出服务端 data（{draft, derivedFrom?}）`\nNote: The `update` action now routes its response through `draft_receipt`, a helper that encodes the revise-flow contract (requires `affectsPublishedContent` present and false, requires a `source_id`). `draft update` has no such field in its documented payload, so the command layer imposes another command's response contract on update instead of leaving response-shape ownership with `content::draft`.",
